        "v": " to exact IDs. Unpinned aliases resolve to Claude Code's built-in default for that provider, which may lag the newest release or not be enabled in your account. Since v2.1.207 the unpinned primary model is Opus, which carries a higher per-token price, so a deployment that never pinned is billed at Opus rates after that upgrade. Pinning lets the organization decide when users move models. [13][14]"
