        "t": "text",
        "v": " when the gateway signs requests itself. A gateway credential replaces the developer's claude.ai subscription for that session and bills per token to the credential's owner; setting only a base URL does not. The trade-off is that the gateway is infrastructure you must keep current with each Claude Code release's request features. [12][15]"
